  m_text: "\t      Tank you for playing\n\n\t\t        \uD300\uC6D0\n\n   \uAC15\uC2B9\uC6B0(\uD300\uC7A5)
    \t\t             \uBC15\uC131\uD604(TA)\n\uCC28\uC2B9\uC7AC(\uD504\uB85C\uADF8\uB798\uBA38,
    \uAE30\uD68D)              \uC624\uB3C4\uD601(\uD504\uB85C\uADF8\uB798\uBA38)\n\n\t\t      
    \uD611\uB825 \uB3C4\uAD6C\n\n\t\uCEE4\uBBA4\uB2C8\uCF00\uC774\uC158 : DISCORD/KAKAO
    TALK\n\t\uBC84\uC804\uAD00\uB9AC : GITHUB\n\t\uB9AC\uC18C\uC2A4 \uBC0F \uC5D0\uC14B
    \uAD00\uB9AC : GOOGLE DRIVE\n\t\uC81C\uC791\uD504\uB85C\uADF8\uB7A8 : UNITY\n\n\t\t    
    \uC774\uC0C1\uD604\uC0C1\n        camrea                       Eyes\n       No_Chair                  
    Materials\n      Many_Eyes\t                     No_Book\n       Nosundo\t                
    PosterMissing\n       Rotate\t\t             Trash\n   ChairDisaphear\t            
    Clean\n\t EXIT\t\t\t   Meterial\n\t          NoFireExtingusher\t\t        \n    
    PosterChange                BookPosition\t\t\t  ARM\t\t            Door_Open\n      
    Door_trill\t              Light\t\n          Mute\t\t\t     Outside\t\n\t          
    Strange_person\n\t       Reversal_manipulation\n\n\n\t       Thank you for playing\n      
    ---------------------------------"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d843dff019049c846b7f8d942334e428, type: 2}
